# The conformance reports a suite writes after a run (`results/<language>.json`).
#
# **Generated, never committed** (D644). A committed report is a claim about a
# corpus made by a suite, and it starts being wrong the moment either moves:
# `manifest.json` gains a required fixture, or a suite stops driving one. Both are
# real regressions, and a committed file turns both into a green diff — CI reads a
# report that describes the last run that happened to write it. `check-languages.mjs`
# is only a gate if what it reads came out of the run in the same breath.
results/
